// Managed by mq-resiliency-lab-for-linux (ansible role apt-autoupdate-off, #1225).
//
// In-guest apt auto-updates are permanently OFF in the lab's baked boxes. The boxes are
// short-lived and rebuilt cold from a fresh base about weekly; that rebuild, enforced by
// the box staleness gate, is the update path. An in-guest updater is redundant and costs
// time and run-to-run variance on every boot (it holds the dpkg lock).
// See docs/development/box-model.md section 5.
APT::Periodic::Enable "0";
APT::Periodic::Update-Package-Lists "0";
APT::Periodic::Download-Upgradeable-Packages "0";
APT::Periodic::AutocleanInterval "0";
APT::Periodic::Unattended-Upgrade "0";
